<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>ScscriptriPt</title><description>理智欠费，仍在输出。安全、AGI 与其他怪东西。</description><link>https://scscriptript.github.io/</link><atom:link href="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <language>zh</language> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>ScscriptriPt</title> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/</link> </image> <item> <title>DDD 领域驱动设计</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;软件工程为什么难以公式化？从《人月神话》到焦油坑，聊聊这种模糊性为什么会让“架构思维”变成群魔乱舞。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/ddd-%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/ddd-%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</guid> </item> <item> <title>AI渗透吗</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;Agent 进入渗透测试后，被替代的不是工具本身，而是“人手动跑工具、人肉读输出”这一层；真正的代差在并行与全量审计。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/ai%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E5%90%97/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/ai%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E5%90%97/</guid> </item> <item> <title>风口还是赌博</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;当你在某个方面投入了很多，或者客观上不算很多，但是主观上已经投入了很多时，这些沉默成本你还有勇气收回来吗？&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;常说站在风口上，猪也能起飞。你可以确定自己走在风口，还是自顾自做了一场没来由的赌博呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E9%A3%8E%E5%8F%A3%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%B5%8C%E5%8D%9A/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E9%A3%8E%E5%8F%A3%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%B5%8C%E5%8D%9A/</guid> </item> <item> <title>电子阳痿</title> <author>None</author> <description>&lt;p&gt;为什么连玩游戏都要追求审美和成就？从电子阳痿谈起，聊聊优绩主义如何把娱乐变成另一种工作。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%98%B3%E7%97%BF/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E9%98%B3%E7%97%BF/</guid> </item> <item> <title>安全的未来在哪</title> <description>&lt;p&gt;AI-Agent 渗透让传统手工渗透显得岌岌可危，但出路可能不在更卷的 Web，而在硬件、固件、工控、车联网与物联网。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA/</guid> </item> <item> <title>停止所谓的“为了你好”</title> <author>None</author> <description>&lt;p&gt;以“送东西”和家里的快递为例，聊聊以爱为名的强迫给予，以及边界感被压缩后的疲惫。&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%80%E8%B0%93%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:42:51 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://scscriptript.github.io/feed_rss_updated.xml">ScscriptriPt</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%80%E8%B0%93%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD/</guid> </item> </channel> </rss>